{"headword":"מָנַע","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb. withhold, hold back (</strong>NH <em>id.;</em> Zinj. <span dir=\"rtl\">מנע</span> DHM<sup>Sendsch. 60</sup>; Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">مَنَعَ</span>; Sab. <span dir=\"rtl\">מנע</span> Levy-Os<sup>ZMG xix. 1865, 268</sup>; Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">מְנַע</span><strong>)</strong>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:2\" href=\"/Genesis.30.2\">Gn 30:2</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְנָעַ֫נִי</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 25:34\" href=\"/I_Samuel.25.34\">1 S 25:34</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מָנַ֫עְתָּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 21:3\" href=\"/Psalms.21.3\">ψ 21:3</a> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 9:20\" href=\"/Nehemiah.9.20\">Ne 9:20</a>, etc.; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִמְנַע־</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 84:12\" href=\"/Psalms.84.12\">ψ 84:12</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִמְנָעֵ֫נִי</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 13:13\" href=\"/II_Samuel.13.13\">2 S 13:13</a> etc.; Imv. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְנַע</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 1:15\" href=\"/Proverbs.1.15\">Pr 1:15</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מִנְעִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 2:25\" href=\"/Jeremiah.2.25\">Je 2:25</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.16\">31:16</a>; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">מֹנֵעַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 11:26\" href=\"/Proverbs.11.26\">Pr 11:26</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.10\">Je 48:10</a>;—<em>withhold</em>, sq. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:2\" href=\"/Genesis.30.2\">Gn 30:2</a> (obj. <span dir=\"rtl\">פְּרִי־בֶטֶן</span>), <a data-ref=\"Amos 4:7\" href=\"/Amos.4.7\">Am 4:7</a> (rain), <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 9:20\" href=\"/Nehemiah.9.20\">Ne 9:20</a> (manna; all subj. <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>); <a data-ref=\"Job 22:7\" href=\"/Job.22.7\">Jb 22:7</a> (bread), <a data-ref=\"I Kings 20:7\" href=\"/I_Kings.20.7\">1 K 20:7</a> (obj. om.; both hum. subj.), so <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.10\">Je 48:10</a> (sword), <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 2:10\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.2.10\">Ec 2:10</a> (heart), <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 5:25\" href=\"/Jeremiah.5.25\">Je 5:25</a> (good), <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 3:27\" href=\"/Proverbs.3.27\">Pr 3:27</a> (<em>id.</em>), <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 1:15\" href=\"/Proverbs.1.15\">1:15</a> (foot); <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 2:25\" href=\"/Jeremiah.2.25\">Je 2:25</a> (<em>id.</em>) <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.16\">31:16</a> (voice); further, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 13:13\" href=\"/II_Samuel.13.13\">2 S 13:13</a> (woman), <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 42:4\" href=\"/Jeremiah.42.4\">Je 42:4</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(דָּבָר)</span>, <a data-ref=\"Job 31:16\" href=\"/Job.31.16\">Jb 31:16</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">מן</span> part.), <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 23:13\" href=\"/Proverbs.23.13\">Pr 23:13</a> (correction), obj. om. <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> subj. <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 30:7\" href=\"/Proverbs.30.7\">Pr 30:7</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן</span> om. <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 11:26\" href=\"/Proverbs.11.26\">Pr 11:26</a> (obj. corn); cf. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 21:3\" href=\"/Psalms.21.3\">ψ 21:3</a> subj. <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> (obj. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲרֶשֶׁת שְׂפָתָיו</span> ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">נָתַן תַּאֲוַת לֵב</span>), <a data-ref=\"Job 20:13\" href=\"/Job.20.13\">Jb 20:13</a> fig. (wickedness), <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:15\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.15\">Ez 31:15</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> subj. (obj. rivers); obj. pers. <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> subj. sq. <span dir=\"rtl\">מן</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 24:11\" href=\"/Numbers.24.11\">Nu 24:11</a>; sq. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן</span> + inf. <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 25:26\" href=\"/I_Samuel.25.26\">1 S 25:26</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 25:34\" href=\"/I_Samuel.25.34\">34</a>; sq. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְ</span>, subj. <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 84:12\" href=\"/Psalms.84.12\">ψ 84:12</a> (good)."}],"form":"Qal"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">נִמְנַע</span> <a data-ref=\"Joel 1:13\" href=\"/Joel.1.13\">Jo 1:13</a>; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִמָּנַע</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 38:15\" href=\"/Job.38.15\">Jb 38:15</a>, etc.; <em>be withholden</em> sq. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן</span>, subj. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִנְחָה</span> etc. <a data-ref=\"Joel 1:13\" href=\"/Joel.1.13\">Jo 1:13</a>; light from wicked <a data-ref=\"Job 38:15\" href=\"/Job.38.15\">Jb 38:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 22:16\" href=\"/Numbers.22.16\">Nu 22:16</a> (sq. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן</span> + inf.); subj. showers <span dir=\"rtl\">(רְבִבִים)</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 3:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.3.3\">Je 3:3</a>."}],"form":"Niph."}]},"rid":"BDB05537","strong_numbers":["4513"],"next_hw":"יִמְנָע","prev_hw":"מְנֻסָה","all_cited":true,"root":true,"quotes":[],"GK":["4979"],"TWOT":["1216"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}